# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMRSE_00000007> (gender role)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMRSE_00000007> "A human social role borne by a human being being realized in behaviour which is considered socially appropriate for individuals of a specific sex in the context of a specific culture."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMRSE_00000007> "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
